        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sunye, Stephen Pearcy, Park Ye-eun, Sohee, Hyuna\n- Groups: Wonder Girls\n- Roles: missionary, singer, actress, musician\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Pearcy was born on July 3, 1956, and he is an American musician.\n- Sunye was born on August 12, 1989, and she is a South Korean missionary and a former singer and actress on hiatus.\n- Park Ye-eun debuted in 2007 as a member of the South Korean girl group Wonder Girls.\n- Hyuna left Wonder Girls in late 2007.\n- Sunye is also known as Sunye or Sun, with SunYe as a stylized form.\n- Sunye and Sohee officially left Wonder Girls in 2015.",
